### Click ▶ next to a request to run it. Requests are separated by ###.
### These go straight to elev-service (port 8081). New students are created with POST in elev-api.

### 1. All students from the database -> 200
GET http://localhost:8081/elever

### 2. Unknown id -> 404
GET http://localhost:8081/elever/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 3. One student -> 200 (paste an id from request 1)
GET http://localhost:8081/elever/PASTE-ID-HERE

### 4. Health (also checks the database)
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
